#: ../../04-repo-map.md:100 69c16376ba154bf88bc83b07887227c9
msgid ""
"**Naming**: knowledge pages use `NN-slug.md` (stable numbering); helper "
"scripts use `snake_case.py`; catalogs mirror page slugs (`00-overview.po`, "
"`08-lua-nginx-module.po`)."
msgstr ""
"**命名**：知识页面使用 `NN-slug.md`（编号保持稳定）；辅助脚本使用 `snake_case.py`；翻译目录与页面 slug "
"对应（`00-overview.po`、`08-lua-nginx-module.po`）。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:103 e91f2f35f3124d36b70c4fec5a5a33d4
msgid ""
"**Layering**: Lua and `proxy_pass` call `ngx_resolver`. `lua-resty-dns` is a"
" separate client that uses cosockets to talk to DNS itself (documented "
"only)."
msgstr ""
"**分层**：Lua 和 `proxy_pass` 调用 `ngx_resolver`。`lua-resty-dns` 是独立的客户端，它自行使用 "
"cosocket 与 DNS 通信（仅记录）。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:105 35455ef840d34efb8f7b383d06afa47f
msgid ""
"**Module boundaries**: Resolver state stays in `ngx_resolver.c`. Lua only "
"sees `nil, err` from the cosocket."
msgstr "**模块边界**：解析器状态保留在 `ngx_resolver.c` 中。Lua 只能从 cosocket 看到 `nil, err`。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:107 16f2358f7eb54719937ede5f84000396
msgid ""
"**Scripts and tooling**: everything under `doc/scripts/` is run via `uv run "
"--locked`; CI-intended checks are `make build`, `make pkb-check`, `make pkb-"
"check-i18n`."
msgstr ""
"**脚本与工具**：`doc/scripts/` 下的脚本均通过 `uv run --locked` 运行；面向 CI 的检查是 `make "
"build`、`make pkb-check`、`make pkb-check-i18n`。"

